[0.000, "o", "───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[4;35mGoal\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                                                         \r\n\r\nReview tb-0019 against its spec below.                                                                                                                                                                       \r\n\r\n\u001b[4;35mSpec of tb-0019\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                                              \r\n\r\n\u001b[4;35mGoal\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                                                         \r\n\r\nWrite the recipe that prepares the pinned Tart base image on the Mac mini from which every ephemeral run clones: an upstream macOS base image referenced by"]
[0.000, "o", " digest (label it third-party if it is not Apple's\r\nown, as the Target rules require), provisioned once with the runner user, key-only SSH with the dispatch key placeholder, and swamp from the pinned \u001b[1;36;40mswamp-darwin-aarch64\u001b[0m with its checksum. Add a \u001b[1;36;40mbuild_base\u001b[0m \r\nmethod on the Tart model that runs this recipe on the Mac mini host and records the resulting local image name and digest, so the rebuild workflow can refresh it. Extend the recipe validator to cover the  \r\nmacOS recipe.                                                                                                                                                                                                \r\n\r\n\u001b[4;35mRead first\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                                                   \r\n\r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mdocs/plans/runner-fleet.md                                                              "]
[0.000, "o", "                                                                                                                  \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mThe Notes of this fragment's deps under ~/.loops/openskills/done/ (macOS version, disk, Tart installed: in tb-0066, not tb-0017)                                                                          \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mThe Tart model from \u001b[1;36;40mtart-model\u001b[0m and scripts/check-runner-recipes.mjs                                                                                                                                       \r\n\r\n\u001b[4;35mFiles\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                                                        \r\n\r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0minfra/runners/macos/ (new)                                                                                                                                                                                \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mthe Tart"]
[0.000, "o", " model file and its test                                                                                                                                                                          \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mscripts/check-runner-recipes.mjs and scripts/check-runner-recipes.test.mjs                                                                                                                                \r\n\r\n\u001b[4;35mAcceptance\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                                                   \r\n\r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0mTests first: \u001b[1;36;40mbuild_base\u001b[0m refuses a base reference without a digest; the validator passes the recipe and fails an unpinned one.                                                                             \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1;36;40mdeno check\u001b[0m and \u001b[1;36;40mdeno test -A\u001b[0m pass on the Tart model and test; \u001b[1;36;40mnode scripts/check-runner-recipes.mjs infra/ru"]
[0.000, "o", "nners/macos\u001b[0m passes.                                                                            \r\n\u001b[1m • \u001b[0m\u001b[1;36;40mpnpm typecheck\u001b[0m and \u001b[1;36;40mpnpm test\u001b[0m pass.                                                                                                                                                                        \r\n\r\n\u001b[4;35mOperator decision (2026-09-26)\u001b[0m                                                                                                                                                                               \r\n\r\nOperator decision 2026-09-26 (see tb-0075): \u001b[1;36;40mbuild_base\u001b[0m prepares the pinned base image on each Tart host (Mac mini and laptop fallback), each pinned by digest and recorded per host label. The Mac mini has a\r\n256 GB disk: keep one base image and prune the Tart cache after building.                                                                                                                                    \r\n"]
